Concentration-time profiles for drugX plasma concentration (A, D), drugX metabolized by CYP3A4 (B, E) and drugX metabolized by CYP3A4 in liver (C, F) for simulation of an 1mg iv application for an adult population (A, B, C) and simulation of an 5mg oral application for an adult population (D, E, F) on a logarithmic y-scale.
